# Naver blog SEO (콘텐츠·이미지 자동화)

Phone / Cursor remote control lives in `naver-blog-seo/scripts/remote_ctl.py`.

## Commands

```bash
cd naver-blog-seo
python scripts/remote_ctl.py status
python scripts/remote_ctl.py dry-run --count 1   # no browser
python scripts/remote_ctl.py once --count 1      # Selenium write
python scripts/remote_ctl.py schedule            # daily post_times
python scripts/remote_ctl.py stop
```

## Safety

- Do not commit `.env`, `output/naver_cookies.json`, or `dist/`.
- Default: `AUTO_PUBLISH=false` (draft for manual review).
- Only set publish true when the user explicitly asks.
- Captcha / 2FA needs a human on the PC once.

## Config

- Keywords / schedule: `config.yaml`
- Credentials: `.env` (`NAVER_ID`, `NAVER_PW`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`)
